<title>USA: Tesma International Q4 shr up to C$0.25.</title>
<headline>Tesma International Q4 shr up to C$0.25.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996-Q4		  1995-Q4</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.25		    $0.06</p>
<p> Shr diluted     0.23		     0.06</p>
<p> Net		 5,600		    2,200</p>
<p> Sales	     116,500		  95,100</p>
<p>		   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary     $1.05		    $0.62</p>
<p> Shr diluted     0.91		     0.59</p>
<p> Net		 22,500		   14,700</p>
<p> Sales	     455,600		  379,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Tesma International Inc.</p>
<p>All figures in Canadian dollars.</p>
<p>Fiscal year ended July 31.</p>
<p>1995 figures are pro forma. Historic fully diluted earnings per share are not comparable due to increase in number of shares outstanding as a result of 1995 reorganization and initial public offering.</p>
